# Smart Home Model - topic access per login (least privilege).
# A node can only read/write its own subsystem branch, so a faulty or
# compromised node cannot fake another subsystem's alarm (Fernandes [12]).
# Nodes may also read the hub's online/offline status (the climate node turns a
# manual heater off when the hub is gone).

user hub
topic readwrite home/#
topic read $SYS/#

user climate
topic readwrite home/climate/#
topic read home/hub/jarvis/status

user alarm
topic readwrite home/alarm/#
topic read home/hub/jarvis/status

user lighting
topic readwrite home/lighting/#
topic read home/hub/jarvis/status

user solar
topic readwrite home/solar/#
topic read home/hub/jarvis/status

# Test bench (RPi 4B / laptop). Disable this login for the final demo.
user tester
topic readwrite home/#
